n_id":"8c3bd475-db0e-11ef-b309-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛交縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛交县","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"8c3bd476-db0e-11ef-9175-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"犀首，魏官名。公孫衍爲此官，因號犀首，猶虎牙將軍之稱。龍姓出於龍伯氏，或云出於御龍氏。班志，上郡有雕陰道。括地志：雕陰故城，在鄜州洛交縣北二十里。敗，補邁翻。稱，尺證翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"犀首，魏官名。公孙衍为此官，因号犀首，犹虎牙将军之称。龙姓出于龙伯氏，或云出于御龙氏。班志，上郡有雕阴道。括地志：雕阴故城，在鄜州洛交县北二十里。败，补迈翻。称，尺证翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c3bd469-db0e-11ef-a9ab-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言引兵東下也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言引兵东下也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8c3bd479-db0e-11ef-a003-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"雕陰","place_name_jianti_auto":"雕阴","place_note":"陕西富县","resolved_place_entity_id":4142,"start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8c3bd47f-db0e-11ef-93fa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/五、延安府（卷五十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"汉置县。三国魏时县废。旧《志》云：雕阴城在鄜州北三十里。...","context_before":"○雕阴城[县南四十里。战国时魏地。","source_end_index":63,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"cc3014eb-fb2d-5016-a8e0-1f2ee11827b3","source_start_index":17,"source_text":"周显王三十六年，秦犀首伐魏，取雕阴。《史记》：梁襄王五年，秦败我龙贾军四万五千于雕阴。是也。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/五、延安府（卷五十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"會秦使犀首伐魏，大敗其師四萬餘人，禽將龍賈，取雕陰，且欲東兵。蘇秦恐秦兵至趙而敗從約，念莫可使用於秦者，乃激怒張儀，入之於秦。","content_fanyi":"恰逢秦国派犀首率军攻打魏国，大败魏军四万余人，擒获魏将龙贾，夺取魏国城邑雕阴，并准备向东进兵。苏秦担心秦军打到赵国会破坏合纵盟约，考虑到没有合适的人可派往秦国用计，于是激怒张仪，使他前往秦国。","content_jianti_auto":"会秦使犀首伐魏，大败其师四万余人，禽将龙贾，取雕阴，且欲东兵。苏秦恐秦兵至赵而败从约，念莫可使用于秦者，乃激怒张仪，入之于秦。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":187,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 三十六年 / 第 5 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c3bd468-db0e-11ef-915f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-333},"tongjian_id":"8c3bd468-db0e-11ef-915f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"雕陰","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"雕陰郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"雕阴郡","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b5e15453-db0e-11ef-9bc5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"西魏","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b5e15454-db0e-11ef-adbe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b5e15455-db0e-11ef-a869-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"上郡","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"b5e15456-db0e-11ef-afb4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雕陰郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"雕阴郡","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"b5e15457-db0e-11ef-bf05-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"慶州","place_name_jianti_auto":"庆州","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"b5e15458-db0e-11ef-98d2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"弘化郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"弘化郡","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"b5e15459-db0e-11ef-8237-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"隋志：雕陰郡，西魏置綏州，大業初，改爲上郡，尋改爲雕陰郡。改慶州爲弘化郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"隋志：雕阴郡，西魏置绥州，大业初，改为上郡，寻改为雕阴郡。改庆州为弘化郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b5e15452-db0e-11ef-a579-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"煬帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"炀帝","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b5e1545c-db0e-11ef-a158-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鹽川郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"盐川郡","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b5e1545d-db0e-11ef-a32d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"西魏","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b5e1545e-db0e-11ef-ba49-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西安州","place_name_jianti_auto":"西安州","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b5e1545f-db0e-11ef-bafe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鹽州","place_name_jianti_auto":"盐州","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b5e15460-db0e-11ef-89b1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"隋志：鹽川郡，西魏置西安州，後改爲鹽州，煬帝改爲郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"隋志：盐川郡，西魏置西安州，后改为盐州，炀帝改为郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"b5e1545b-db0e-11ef-aac9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"雕陰","place_name_jianti_auto":"雕阴","resolved_place_entity_id":4142,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b5e15463-db0e-11ef-bab9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、南北朝 隋（卷四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"○萧铣，初为罗川令[罗川，今湖广湘阴县东六十里废罗县是。...","context_before":"称梁者三。\n【史略】","source_end_index":225,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6a9de013-b284-5b48-9a05-0a54c65fb14f","source_start_index":10,"source_text":"梁师都，初为朔方鹰扬郎将。大业十三年，作乱据郡，称大丞相。北连突厥，袭取雕阴[故绥州]、弘化[故庆州]、延安等郡，遂称帝，都朔方，国号梁[突厥号为大度毗伽可汗，华言解事也]。引突厥居河南地，攻破盐川郡[故盐州，今为宁夏后卫]。既而数入犯，为唐所败，其地多归于唐。武德五年，克其朔方东城[师都退保西城。《唐书》：武德六年，师都将贺遂索同以所部十二州来降。大约师都所侨置，非实土也]。贞观二年，遣柴绍等击之，进围朔方，其下杀师都以降。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/四、南北朝 隋（卷四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十、榆林镇（卷六十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"唐武德五年，延州总管段德操攻之，克其东城。师都保西城，会...","context_before":"...方，以东缘边险要，筑数十城，是也。大业三年，改为朔方郡。","source_end_index":369,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ccf51c66-e887-5538-8565-4fbaaf682f2b","source_start_index":354,"source_text":"十三年，梁师都据朔方，寻称帝。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十、榆林镇（卷六十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十一、宁夏卫（卷六十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。贞观二年，复置盐州[《旧唐书》：武德初，盐州及五原县俱...","context_before":"...西安州，寻改为盐州。隋初，郡废。大业初，又改州为盐川郡。","source_end_index":85,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f794a46e-ab36-55e8-861c-561ae5994299","source_start_index":76,"source_text":"唐初，为梁师都所据"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十一、宁夏卫（卷六十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"9梁師都略定雕陰、弘化、延安等郡，遂卽皇帝位，國號梁，改元永隆。始畢遺以狼頭纛，號爲大度毗伽可汗。師都乃引突厥居河南之地，攻破鹽川郡。","content_fanyi":"梁师都攻取并平定了雕阴、弘化、延安等郡，随后即皇帝位，以梁为国号，改元永隆。始毕可汗赠给他狼头大旗，称他为大度毗伽可汗。梁师都又招引突厥人居住在河南之地，并攻破盐川郡。","content_jianti_auto":"9梁师都略定雕阴、弘化、延安等郡，遂即皇帝位，国号梁，改元永隆。始毕遗以狼头纛，号为大度毗伽可汗。师都乃引突厥居河南之地，攻破盐川郡。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17724,"number":9,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八十三 (隋紀七) / 恭皇帝上 / 義寧元年 / 第 12 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b5e15451-db0e-11ef-9f36-a0d3651f611f","year_int":617},"tongjian_id":"b5e15451-db0e-11ef-9f36-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"雕陰","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"敦煌公","people_name_jianti_auto":"敦煌公","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9d7-db0e-11ef-91c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"弘基","people_name_jianti_auto":"弘基","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9d8-db0e-11ef-a9f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"開山","people_name_jianti_auto":"开山","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9d9-db0e-11ef-a644-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"涇陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"泾阳","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9da-db0e-11ef-851e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"司竹","place_name_jianti_auto":"司竹","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9db-db0e-11ef-9025-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9dc-db0e-11ef-9fba-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：創業注云：「敦煌公自涇陽趨司竹，留弘基、開山屯長安故城。」今從唐書·弘基傳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：创业注云：「敦煌公自泾阳趋司竹，留弘基、开山屯长安故城。」今从唐书·弘基传。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9d6-db0e-11ef-935c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"阿城","place_name_jianti_auto":"阿城","place_note":"陕西省西安市西","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9e1-db0e-11ef-9281-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9e2-db0e-11ef-b8bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"阿房宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"阿房宫","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9e3-db0e-11ef-9d6f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"趣，七喻翻。帥，讀曰率。阿城，卽秦阿房宮城。","note_content_jianti_auto":"趣，七喻翻。帅，读曰率。阿城，即秦阿房宫城。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9e0-db0e-11ef-b2b6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"新豐縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"新丰县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9e6-db0e-11ef-8807-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京兆郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"京兆郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9e7-db0e-11ef-8eb4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長樂宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"长乐宫","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9e8-db0e-11ef-a9d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9e9-db0e-11ef-894d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"新豐縣屬京兆郡；長樂宮，故漢宮也。樂，音洛。","note_content_jianti_auto":"新丰县属京兆郡；长乐宫，故汉宫也。乐，音洛。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":147,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9e5-db0e-11ef-a819-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"盩厔","place_name_jianti_auto":"盩厔","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9eb-db0e-11ef-b472-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9ec-db0e-11ef-916b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"自盩厔趣長安，故謂之北。","note_content_jianti_auto":"自盩厔趣长安，故谓之北。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":161,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9ea-db0e-11ef-93a7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"並至所期之地聽敎令。","note_content_jianti_auto":"并至所期之地听教令。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":166,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9ed-db0e-11ef-8299-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"冯翊","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9ef-db0e-11ef-95ad-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"自馮翊西行。降，戶江翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"自冯翊西行。降，户江翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":189,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9ee-db0e-11ef-a753-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"春明門","place_name_jianti_auto":"春明门","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9f1-db0e-11ef-a7cb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安城","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安城","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9f2-db0e-11ef-b492-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"春明門，長安城東面三門之中門也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"春明门，长安城东面三门之中门也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":229,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9f0-db0e-11ef-a6ed-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"安興坊","place_name_jianti_auto":"安兴坊","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9f4-db0e-11ef-b0fe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安興門","place_name_jianti_auto":"安兴门","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9f5-db0e-11ef-badd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安城","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安城","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9f6-db0e-11ef-ba90-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"通化","place_name_jianti_auto":"通化","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9f7-db0e-11ef-a22f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春明","place_name_jianti_auto":"春明","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9f8-db0e-11ef-95fe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安興","place_name_jianti_auto":"安兴","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9f9-db0e-11ef-9e9d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"安興坊，蓋在安興門外。雍錄：長安城東面三門，通化、春明、安興。帥，讀曰率。","note_content_jianti_auto":"安兴坊，盖在安兴门外。雍录：长安城东面三门，通化、春明、安兴。帅，读曰率。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":297,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9f3-db0e-11ef-bbe6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"雕陰","place_name_jianti_auto":"雕阴","place_note":"陕西绥德","resolved_place_entity_id":4142,"start_index":172,"tongjian_id":"b61bba17-db0e-11ef-9733-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/开元宫嫔","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。其多可想。","context_before":"...宫遍天下，所在皆置宫女。故裴寂为晋阳宫监，以私侍高祖。及","source_end_index":170,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"019db343-a1eb-4184-b498-1475428e1833","source_start_index":159,"source_text":"高祖义师经过处，悉罢之"}],"path":"五笔/卷三/开元宫嫔","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"坊在安兴门外，自都城东行者，多出是门。故唐人诗云：“春明...","context_before":"...至德三载，改曰达礼门]。东面三门：正中曰春明门[隋名也。","source_end_index":2872,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8851a334-ca2b-5400-bb0d-e71691f9c4ec","source_start_index":2845,"source_text":"唐公李渊义师至长安，营于春明门西北，既又迁馆于安兴坊。"},{"context_after":"广明初，黄巢入关，田令孜以帝自金光门出，趣骆谷，是也。《...","context_before":"...收京城，耀兵通化门外]。西面三门：正中曰金光门[隋名也。","source_end_index":3006,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8851a334-ca2b-5400-bb0d-e71691f9c4ec","source_start_index":2986,"source_text":"唐初举义师，刘弘基次长安城，振队金光门。"},{"context_after":"《三辅故事》：长安城中有八街、九陌。汉京兆尹张敞走马章台...","context_before":"...置安夷护军于城内，其后更迭为宫邑。隋建新都，始移于今所。","source_end_index":407,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"10d45da5-d1d3-5588-97f1-54beb6adee74","source_start_index":362,"source_text":"大业十三年，唐公渊义师渡河，军冯翊，遣刘弘基等南渡渭，军长安故城。既而世民亦自阿城进屯焉。"},{"context_after":"《一统志》：阿房宫在今咸阳县东二十五里]。","context_before":"...中大乱。太元九年，慕容冲败秦兵于灞上，遂据阿房以逼长安。","source_end_index":317,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"1dcd1259-4166-5efb-9fe5-b128da6badf7","source_start_index":290,"source_text":"隋末，李世民入关，自泾阳引兵趣司竹，还顿于阿城，即此。"},{"context_after":"天宝以后，废。○章台宫，在长安故城中，秦宫也。中有章台，...","context_before":"...赤眉入长安，刘盆子复居长乐宫。后废。西魏以后，复修治之。","source_end_index":291,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f9f569fd-89aa-5149-9c50-8d1c056cefdf","source_start_index":231,"source_text":"隋大业十三年，唐公渊军冯翊，进趣长安，命世子建成等自永丰西趣新丰，进至长乐宫。既而渊入长安，还屯长乐宫，与民约法十二条。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"淵命劉弘基、殷開山分兵西略扶風，有衆六萬，南渡渭水，屯長安故城。城中出戰，弘基逆擊，破之。世民引兵趣司竹，李仲文、何潘仁、向善志皆帥衆從之，頓于阿城，勝兵十三萬，軍令嚴整，秋毫不犯。乙亥，世民自盩厔遣使白淵，請期日赴長安。淵曰：「屈突東行不能復西，不足虞矣！」乃命建成選倉上精兵自新豐趣長樂宮，世民帥新附諸軍北屯長安故城，至並聽敎。延安、上郡、雕陰皆請降於淵。丙子，淵引軍西行，所過離宮園苑皆罷之，出宮女還其親屬。冬，十月，辛巳，淵至長安，營於春明門之西北，諸軍皆集，合二十餘萬。淵命各依壁壘，毋得入村落侵暴。屢遣使至城下諭衞文昇等以欲尊隋之意，不報。辛卯，命諸軍進圍城。甲午，淵遷館於安興坊。","content_fanyi":"李渊命令刘弘基、殷开山分兵向西攻取扶风，共有部众六万人，向南渡过渭水，屯驻在长安故城。长安城中的隋军出城交战，刘弘基率军迎击，将其打败。李世民率兵直趋司竹，李仲文、何潘仁、向善志都率领部众跟随，驻扎在阿城，能作战的士兵共有十三万，军令严整，秋毫无犯。九月二十七日乙亥，李世民从盩厔派使者向李渊报告，请求约定进兵长安的日期。李渊说：“屈突通已经向东进兵，不能再折回向西，不值得忧虑了！”于是命令李建成挑选永丰仓的精兵，从新丰直趋长乐宫；命令李世民率领新近归附的各军北上屯驻长安故城，到达指定地点后一并听候调遣。延安、上郡、雕阴等郡都向李渊请求投降。九月二十八日丙子，李渊率军向西进发，所经过的隋炀帝离宫园苑一律罢废，放出宫女归还她们的亲属。冬季，十月初四日辛巳，李渊抵达长安，在春明门西北扎营，各路军队全部会集，合计二十余万人。李渊命令各军依托各自营垒驻扎，不得进入村落侵扰施暴。李渊多次派遣使者到城下，向卫文昇等人说明自己想要尊奉隋室的心意，没有得到答复。十月十四日辛卯，李渊命令各路军队进兵包围长安城。十月十七日甲午，李渊把中军指挥部迁到安兴坊。","content_jianti_auto":"渊命刘弘基、殷开山分兵西略扶风，有众六万，南渡渭水，屯长安故城。城中出战，弘基逆击，破之。世民引兵趣司竹，李仲文、何潘仁、向善志皆帅众从之，顿于阿城，胜兵十三万，军令严整，秋毫不犯。乙亥，世民自盩厔遣使白渊，请期日赴长安。渊曰：「屈突东行不能复西，不足虞矣！」乃命建成选仓上精兵自新丰趣长乐宫，世民帅新附诸军北屯长安故城，至并听教。延安、上郡、雕阴皆请降于渊。丙子，渊引军西行，所过离宫园苑皆罢之，出宫女还其亲属。冬，十月，辛巳，渊至长安，营于春明门之西北，诸军皆集，合二十余万。渊命各依壁垒，毋得入村落侵暴。屡遣使至城下谕衞文升等以欲尊隋之意，不报。辛卯，命诸军进围城。甲午，渊迁馆于安兴坊。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17793,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八十四 (隋紀八) / 恭皇帝下 / 義寧元年 / 第 43 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"b61bb9d5-db0e-11ef-8185-a0d3651f611f","year_int":617},"tongjian_id":"b61bb9d5-db0e-11ef-8185-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":3},"place_name":"雕陰"},"message":"success","success":true}